d":"th-qi036-chao-35","person_id":"tfp_yjk_ts4","title":"白從","kind":"unclassified","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-036","source_id":"s-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-ws1492438","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p009","quote":"輙攝白從王永先到臺辨問「超宗有何罪過，詣諸貴皆有不遜言語，竝依事列對」。永先列稱：「主人超宗恒行來詣諸貴要，每多觸忤，言語怨懟。與張敬兒周旋，許結姻好，自敬兒死後，惋歎忿慨。今月初詣李安民，語論『張敬兒不應死』。安民道『敬兒書疏，墨迹炳然，卿何忽作此語』？其中多有不遜之言，小人不悉盡羅縷諳憶。」如其辭列，則與風聞符同。超宗罪自已彰，宜附常准。","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p009:m0004"}],"attestations":[{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p009","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"白從","id":"th-qi036-chao-35:a1","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p009:m0004","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"白從是袁彖攝問永先時所書身份。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"th-wyd-qi036-chao-36","person_id":"tfp_yjk_ts4","title":"白從","kind":"unclassified","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-036","source_id":"s-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-wyd1739","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-wyd","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-wyd:p009","quote":"輒攝白從王永先到臺辨問超宗有何罪過詣諸貴皆有不遜言語並依事列對永先列稱主人超宗恒行來詣諸貴要每多觸忤言語怨懟與張敬兒周旋許結姻好自敬兒死後惋歎忿慨今月初詣李安民語論張敬兒不應死安民道敬兒書疏墨迹炳然卿何忽作此語其中多有不遜之言小人不悉盡羅縷諳憶如其辭列則與風聞符同超宗罪自己彰宜附常准","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-wyd:p009:m0004"}],"attestations":[{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-wyd:p009","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"白從","id":"th-wyd-qi036-chao-36:a1","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-wyd:p009:m0004","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expres